摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Unofficial community mobile client for the DeepSeek Harness Web UI.","id":"gh:1337349380","install_available":false,"language":"TypeScript","name":"DSH-Mobile","slug":"SimonMedy/DSH-Mobile","topics":["ai","ai-agents","android","deepseek","deepseek-ai","deepseek-harness","deepseek-v4","dsh","dsh-plugin","ios","mobile-app","react-native","remote-access","tailscale","tailwind","typescript"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Unofficial community mobile client for the DeepSeek Harness Web UI."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# DSH Mobile"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"A focused, unofficial community mobile client for the official **DeepSeek Harness** Web UI."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"DSH Mobile does not run Harness on your phone. It connects to user-operated remote DeepSeek Harness "},{"id":"p4s2","text":"instances and displays the official Web UI inside a hardened, isolated mobile WebView shell."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Quick Start: Connecting to DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"### 1. Start your DeepSeek Harness server"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"On your machine or remote workstation:"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"### 2. Expose it securely to your mobile devices"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"By design, DeepSeek Harness binds to `127.0.0.1` to prevent unauthenticated remote code execution. T"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"o access it securely from your phone, use **Tailscale** (recommended) or an authenticated reverse pr"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"cess it securely from your phone, use **Tailscale** (recommended) or an authenticated reverse proxy:"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"### 3. Connect from DSH Mobile"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"1. Open **DSH Mobile** on your device (Download latest APK).\n2. Tap **`+ Add server`**.\n3. Fill in y"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"our server details:\n- **With Option A (HTTPS):** Protocol `HTTPS`, Host `my-pc.tailnet.ts.net`, Port"},{"id":"p13s3","text":" `443`\n- **With Option B (HTTP):** Protocol `HTTP`, Host `100.x.y.z` (your Tailscale IPv4), Port `30"},{"id":"p13s4","text":"80`\n4. Tap **Test Connection** to verify reachability, then **Save**."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"> [!NOTE]\n> **API Keys & Workspaces**: Upstream DeepSeek Harness intentionally restricts host settin"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"gs, API key configuration, and the native folder picker dialog (`PRIVILEGED_METHODS`) to `localhost`"},{"id":"p14s3","text":" (`127.0.0.1`) for cybersecurity. Set up your model API keys and select your workspaces once on your"},{"id":"p14s4","text":" for cybersecurity. Set up your model API keys and select your workspaces once on your host machine."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## Architecture"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"- **No Harness fork:** Runs against vanilla upstream DeepSeek Harness.\n- **Zero local overhead:** Al"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"l AI models, agents, shells, and workspace tools run on your host machine.\n- **Isolated navigation:*"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"* Same-origin policy keeps internal links in-app and routes external links to the system browser."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"- **Multi-Server Management:** Save and organize multiple named server instances (Home, Work, Cloud "},{"id":"p19s2","text":"VPS).\n- **DeepSeek Design Alignment:** Tailored dark/light theme, DeepSeek pill button system, and c"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"osmic ambient glow.\n- **Android Adaptive Icons:** Native squircle/circle launcher icon with Material"},{"id":"p19s4","text":" You monochrome support.\n- **Live Health Checks:** Real-time connectivity status pill, latency feedb"},{"id":"p19s5","text":"ack, and last-connected history.\n- **Launch Preferences:** Open directly to your default server or t"},{"id":"p19s6","text":"he server list.\n- **Security & Privacy:** Local-only credential-free persistence, unsaved edit prote"},{"id":"p19s7","text":"ction, and explicit confirmation for unencrypted public HTTP endpoints.\n- **Offline Recovery:** Buil"},{"id":"p19s8","text":"t-in reconnect and error handling without exposing raw browser crash screens."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## Known Limitations"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"- **Upstream Host Settings & API Keys:** DeepSeek Harness intentionally locks settings mutation (`se"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"ttings.*`, `credentials.*`) to `localhost` (`127.0.0.1`) because it does not yet feature user authen"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"tication. Configure model provider API keys once on your host machine.\n- **Native Folder Picker:** T"},{"id":"p21s4","text":"he \"Choose workspace\" button triggers a native host OS file explorer (`host.pickDirectory`) on the p"},{"id":"p21s5","text":"hysical PC. Select or open your project workspace on the host machine first (or launch `dsh web` ins"},{"id":"p21s6","text":"ide your workspace directory); it will then appear in your mobile workspace picker.\n- **Upstream Web"},{"id":"p21s7","text":" Layout:** DSH Mobile displays the official upstream Web UI. Desktop-specific layout elements within"},{"id":"p21s8","text":" the Harness web frontend remain managed upstream."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"### Quick Start (Docker / Make — Recommended)"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"No manual Android SDK or Java installation required on your host machine:"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"### Local Toolchain"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"Prerequisites: Node.js `24.19.0` with npm `11.17.0`, plus standard Android Studio / Xcode SDKs."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"On macOS for iOS:"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"Quality check:"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"## Upstream & Disclaimer"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"- **Official DeepSeek Harness:** https://deepseek.com/harness/en/\n- **Upstream Repository:** https:/"},{"id":"p34s2","text":"/github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"_DeepSeek Harness is an independent project created by DeepSeek AI. DSH Mobile is an unofficial comm"},{"id":"p35s2","text":"unity client and is not affiliated with or endorsed by DeepSeek._"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"## Security"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"Read `SECURITY.md` before exposing a Harness instance remotely. DSH provides full developer-level ag"},{"id":"p37s2","text":"ent and tool execution on your host machine; never expose an unauthenticated raw DSH port to the pub"},{"id":"p37s3","text":"execution on your host machine; never expose an unauthenticated raw DSH port to the public Internet."},{"id":"p38s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"MIT. DeepSeek Harness remains governed by its own upstream license."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
